public.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands_task_id_fkey|f|true|false|false|true|FOREIGN KEY (task_id) REFERENCES public.tasks(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT
public.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands_work_order_id_fkey|f|true|false|false|true|FOREIGN KEY (work_order_id) REFERENCES public.task_work_orders(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT
public.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands.universal_v1_prepared_financial_completion_shape_chk|c|true|false|false|false|CHECK (((operation_kind = 'CAPTURE'::text) = ((completion_fact_id IS NOT NULL) AND (completion_version IS NOT NULL))))
public.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands.universal_v1_prepared_financial_idempotency_uniq|u|true|false|false|true|UNIQUE (idempotency_key)
public.universal_v1_prepared_financial_commands.universal_v1_prepared_financial_lifecycle_version_uniq|u|true|false|false|true|UNIQUE (task_draft_id, lifecycle_expected_version)
